introSlug: commercial-paving
intro:
  heading: "High-Durability Commercial Paving Throughout Massachusetts"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      S. Phaneuf & Associates is a premier commercial asphalt paving contractor serving commercial property managers, industrial park developers, retail plazas, and HOA communities across Massachusetts. With 35+ years of heavy civil paving experience, we deliver durable, MassDOT-spec pavement installations built to withstand heavy truck wheel loads and severe New England freeze-thaw cycles.
    - >
      Commercial asphalt paving requires deep subgrade engineering. We excavate unsuitable native soil, install heavy geotextile stabilization fabric, and compact 6 to 10 inches of processed aggregate gravel base. Our crews apply dense hot-mix asphalt (HMA) binder and top courses using heavy vibratory rollers to achieve maximum structural density.
    - >
      Whether you are constructing a new commercial parking lot, repaving an industrial access road, or resurfacing a retail plaza, S. Phaneuf & Associates provides complete end-to-end paving services under a single contract.

